{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["便雅悯地亚拿突城的祭司中，希勒家的儿子耶利米的话记在下面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["犹大王亚们的儿子约西亚在位十三年，耶和华的话临到耶利米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["从犹大王约西亚的儿子约雅敬在位的时候，直到犹大王约西亚的儿子西底家在位的末年，就是十一年五月间耶路撒冷人被掳的时候，耶和华的话也常临到耶利米。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米蒙选召"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶利米说，耶和华的话临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我未将你造在腹中，我已晓得你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你未出母胎，我已分别你为圣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已派你作列国的先知。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我就说：主耶和华啊，我不知怎样说，因为我是年幼的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和华对我说：",{"text":"你不要说我是年幼的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我差遣你到谁那里去，你都要去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我吩咐你说什么话，你都要说。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不要惧怕他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我与你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要拯救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"于是耶和华伸手按我的口，对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已将当说的话传给你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我今日立你在列邦列国之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为要施行拔出、拆毁、毁坏、倾覆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又要建立、栽植。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["两个异象"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华的话又临到我说：「耶利米，你看见什么？」我说：「我看见一根杏树枝。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和华对我说：「你看得不错；因为我留意保守我的话，使得成就。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和华的话第二次临到我说：「你看见什么？」我说：「我看见一个烧开的锅，从北而倾。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和华对我说：「必有灾祸从北方发出，临到这地的一切居民。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶和华说：「看哪，我要召北方列国的众族；他们要来，各安座位在耶路撒冷的城门口，周围攻击城墙，又要攻击犹大的一切城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["至于这民的一切恶，就是离弃我、向别神烧香、跪拜自己手所造的，我要发出我的判语，攻击他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["所以你当束腰，起来将我所吩咐你的一切话告诉他们；不要因他们惊惶，免得我使你在他们面前惊惶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["看哪，我今日使你成为坚城、铁柱、铜墙，与全地和犹大的君王、首领、祭司，并地上的众民反对。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["他们要攻击你，却不能胜你；因为我与你同在，要拯救你。这是耶和华说的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}